WEBVTT

00:00:01.258 --> 00:00:05.562
The Last of the Mohicans by James Fenimore Cooper.

00:00:05.622 --> 00:00:08.784
Retold by John Esquitt.

00:00:08.844 --> 00:00:30.548
Chapter 1 The Two Sisters It was the year 1757.

00:00:30.608 --> 00:00:37.922
The place was the dangerous and wild land west of the Hudson River.

00:00:37.982 --> 00:00:42.444
It was the third year of the war in North America.

00:00:42.504 --> 00:00:46.316
The war was between England and France.

00:00:46.376 --> 00:00:50.408
Each country wanted the land for itself.

00:00:50.468 --> 00:00:54.884
Indian tribes had always lived in that land.

00:00:54.944 --> 00:01:03.462
In the war, some tribes were fighting for the French, other tribes were fighting for the English.

00:01:03.522 --> 00:01:07.634
Fort Edward was on the Hudson River.

00:01:07.694 --> 00:01:13.426
General Webb was the commander of the English Army at Fort Edward.

00:01:13.486 --> 00:01:17.328
He was waiting for news of General Montcom.

00:01:17.389 --> 00:01:21.761
Montcom was the commander of the French Army.

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:24.780
The news came one morning.

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:28.578
an Indian called Magua arrived.

00:01:28.638 --> 00:01:37.770
Moncam and the French Army are coming towards Fort William Henry, Magua told General Webb.

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:42.591
Fort William Henry was fifteen miles away.

00:01:42.651 --> 00:01:46.632
It was at the south end of Lake Horican.

00:01:46.692 --> 00:01:49.843
How many men has Moncam got?

00:01:49.903 --> 00:01:51.344
Asked Webb.

00:01:51.404 --> 00:01:56.397
As many as the leaves on the trees said Magua.

00:01:56.457 --> 00:02:02.479
General Monroe wants more soldiers at Fort William Henry.

00:02:02.538 --> 00:02:08.400
I will send 1500 men, said General Webb.

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:14.692
General Monroe was the commander of the English Army at Fort William Henry.

00:02:14.752 --> 00:02:18.886
He had two daughters, Cora and Alice.

00:02:18.946 --> 00:02:25.615
Cora was about 23 years old and Alice was 18.

00:02:25.674 --> 00:02:30.338
Cora had dark hair and a beautiful face.

00:02:30.398 --> 00:02:34.962
Alice had fair hair and blue eyes.

00:02:35.022 --> 00:02:42.648
These two young women were at Fort Edward, but they were going to travel to Fort William Henry.

00:02:42.708 --> 00:02:45.710
They were going to meet their father.

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:50.142
General Webb spoke to Cora and Alice.

00:02:50.202 --> 00:02:55.394
Magua knows a secret path through the forest, Sir General Webb.

00:02:55.454 --> 00:02:57.324
He will be your guide.

00:02:57.384 --> 00:03:03.646
Magua and Major Duncan Hayward will take you to Fort William Henry.

00:03:03.706 --> 00:03:08.638
Major Duncan Hayward was a young English officer.

00:03:08.698 --> 00:03:12.700
He and the two young women left Fort Edward.

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:14.953
They rode on horses.

00:03:15.012 --> 00:03:17.726
Magua walked in front of them.

00:03:17.786 --> 00:03:20.560
Alice watched Magua.

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:23.632
I don't like him, Cora, she said.

00:03:23.692 --> 00:03:25.153
What do you think?

00:03:25.213 --> 00:03:28.716
Will we be safe in the forest with Magua?

00:03:28.776 --> 00:03:32.230
We must trust Magua, said Cora.

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:38.914
The French know our soldiers' paths, said Duncan, but Magua's path is secret.

00:03:38.974 --> 00:03:43.165
He smiled at Alice, and she smiled at him.

00:03:43.225 --> 00:03:46.894
Duncan Hayward was in love with Alice.

00:03:46.954 --> 00:03:52.826
Magua is a Huron, said Duncan, but he lived with a Mohawks.

00:03:52.886 --> 00:03:56.218
The Mohawks are friends of the English.

00:03:56.278 --> 00:03:58.389
Magua came to us.

00:03:58.449 --> 00:04:02.241
Your father, Duncan, stopped.

00:04:02.301 --> 00:04:07.884
Then he said, but I don't remember all the story.

00:04:07.944 --> 00:04:14.380
Duncan knew more about Magua But he did not tell Cora and Alice.

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:20.434
He did not say, a few years ago, your father's men beat Magua.

00:04:20.495 --> 00:04:23.446
Now Magua hates your father.

00:04:23.506 --> 00:04:27.540
Duncan did not want to frighten the young women.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:39.994
So they followed Magua through the forest.

00:04:40.054 --> 00:05:00.380
Chapter 2 Lost in the Forest A few miles west of Fort Edward, three men were sitting near a river.

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:02.930
Two of the men were Indians.

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:05.452
The other was a white man.

00:05:05.512 --> 00:05:10.093
Chingaczguk and his son, Unkas, were Mohicans.

00:05:10.153 --> 00:05:14.205
The white man was a scout called Hawkeye.

00:05:14.265 --> 00:05:17.680
Hawkeye had a long hunting gun.

00:05:17.739 --> 00:05:19.774
The three men were talking.

00:05:19.794 --> 00:05:25.896
"'My tribe is the oldest Indian tribe,' Chingacuk said.

00:05:25.916 --> 00:05:30.718
"'The blood of the Mohican chiefs is in me.'

00:05:30.778 --> 00:05:37.080
Many summers ago, my tribe came here to the land of the Delaware's.

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:40.351
"'Where are the Mohicans now?'

00:05:40.411 --> 00:05:41.462
asked Hawkeye.

00:05:41.482 --> 00:05:45.603
"'Where are the flowers of those summers?'

00:05:45.663 --> 00:05:47.831
said Chingacuk.

00:05:47.891 --> 00:05:50.108
All dead.

00:05:50.168 --> 00:05:56.090
After my death, UNKUS will be the last of the Mohicans.

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:59.002
Suddenly, they heard a noise.

00:05:59.061 --> 00:06:01.072
They turned quickly.

00:06:01.132 --> 00:06:03.543
Hawkeye lifted his gun.

00:06:03.603 --> 00:06:04.804
Who is it?

00:06:04.864 --> 00:06:06.134
He said.

00:06:06.194 --> 00:06:09.795
Duncan Hayward wrote out of the forest.

00:06:09.855 --> 00:06:12.566
Cora and Alice followed him.

00:06:12.626 --> 00:06:15.917
I am an English officer, Duncan said.

00:06:15.977 --> 00:06:18.346
We have come from Fort Edward.

00:06:18.405 --> 00:06:21.534
How far is it to Fort William Henry?

00:06:21.594 --> 00:06:23.285
Hawkeye laughed.

00:06:23.345 --> 00:06:28.387
Fort William Henry, you are going the wrong way, he said.

00:06:28.447 --> 00:06:31.499
You are near Glenn's Falls.

00:06:31.558 --> 00:06:34.590
The wrong way, said Duncan.

00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:36.311
Then we are lost.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:42.433
But our Indian guide, you have an Indian guide, but you are lost in the forest?

00:06:42.493 --> 00:06:43.634
Said Hawkeye.

00:06:43.694 --> 00:06:45.724
That is very strange.

00:06:45.784 --> 00:06:47.814
Is he a Delaware?

00:06:47.874 --> 00:06:49.945
He is called Magua.

00:06:50.005 --> 00:06:52.187
He is a Huron," said Duncan.

00:06:52.247 --> 00:06:59.001
But he lives with a Mohawks, and he is a guide for a Huron, said Hawkeye quickly.

00:06:59.061 --> 00:07:04.935
You can trust a Mohican or a Delaware, but you cannot trust a Huron.

00:07:04.995 --> 00:07:08.027
Your guide will lead you to his friends.

00:07:08.087 --> 00:07:09.658
They will kill you.

00:07:09.718 --> 00:07:11.520
Let me see him.

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:15.302
Magua was standing behind Cora's horse.

00:07:15.362 --> 00:07:17.189
Hawkeye looked at him.

00:07:17.248 --> 00:07:21.726
Then he went and spoke to Chingacuk and UNKAS.

00:07:21.785 --> 00:07:24.767
Magua moved quickly.

00:07:24.827 --> 00:07:26.968
He ran into the forest.

00:07:27.028 --> 00:07:31.200
Hawkeye, Chingacuk and UNKAS ran after him.

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:33.890
But Magua escaped.

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:36.892
What can I do, Thought Duncan?

00:07:36.952 --> 00:07:38.512
We are lost.

00:07:38.572 --> 00:07:40.473
He turned to Hawkeye.

00:07:40.533 --> 00:07:43.064
Will you take us to Fort William Henry?

00:07:43.124 --> 00:07:43.984
He asked.

00:07:44.044 --> 00:07:45.916
We will give you money.

00:07:45.976 --> 00:07:49.380
Hawkeye looked at Korra and Alice.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:52.131
We will take you, he told Duncan.

00:07:52.191 --> 00:07:54.562
Money is not important.

00:07:54.622 --> 00:07:58.605
We will not leave you and the two young women here.

00:07:58.664 --> 00:08:02.216
Magua and his Huron friends will find you.

00:08:02.276 --> 00:08:05.028
Come now, quickly.

00:08:05.088 --> 00:08:09.320
Duncan and Hawkeye spoke to Korra and Alice.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:11.892
The sisters got off their horses.

00:08:11.951 --> 00:08:15.038
The Mohicans took the animals away.

00:08:15.098 --> 00:08:20.207
They will hide the horses until the morning," said Hawkeye.

00:08:20.267 --> 00:08:25.382
He pulled a canoe from the tall grass at the side of the river.

00:08:25.441 --> 00:08:27.924
Get into the canoe, he said.

00:08:27.984 --> 00:08:32.778
We will go to a cave, and we will stay there tonight.

00:08:32.838 --> 00:08:37.572
Duncan, Cora, and Alice got into the canoe.

00:08:37.633 --> 00:08:41.206
Hawkeye pushed the canoe to the middle of the river.

00:08:41.266 --> 00:08:43.646
Then he got into the canoe.

00:08:43.706 --> 00:08:46.906
He started to paddle along the river.

00:08:46.966 --> 00:08:51.509
Soon they heard the sound of a great waterfall in front of them.

00:08:51.569 --> 00:08:53.590
Glens falls.

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:58.683
A few minutes later, they saw the waterfall.

00:08:58.743 --> 00:09:03.766
Hawkeye paddled the canoe close to the great waterfall.

00:09:03.826 --> 00:09:05.657
Alice was afraid.

00:09:05.717 --> 00:09:07.768
She closed her eyes.

00:09:07.828 --> 00:09:11.954
Hawkeye stopped the canoe by a large, flat rock.

00:09:12.014 --> 00:09:16.390
Cora, Alice, and Duncan got out of the canoe.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:19.993
Wait on the flat rock, Hawkeye said to them.

00:09:20.053 --> 00:09:22.615
I will bring the Mohicans.

00:09:22.675 --> 00:09:28.680
A few minutes later, Hawkeye came back with Chingotchkuk and Unkas.

00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:33.874
The scout led everybody to a cave behind the waterfall.

00:09:33.935 --> 00:09:38.498
The cave was deep and narrow and dark.

00:09:38.558 --> 00:09:42.039
Hawkeye immediately made a fire.

00:09:42.099 --> 00:09:46.876
Alice looked at the tall young Mohican, Anka's.

00:09:46.936 --> 00:09:52.397
A strong man is guarding us, she said quietly to her sister.

00:09:52.457 --> 00:10:05.602
We will be safe tonight.

00:10:05.661 --> 00:10:18.023
Chapter Three.

00:10:18.083 --> 00:10:22.066
The fight at Glenn's Falls.

00:10:22.126 --> 00:10:27.220
Hawkeye woke Duncan early the next morning.

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:29.492
We must go, he said.

00:10:29.552 --> 00:10:31.443
I will get the canoe.

00:10:31.503 --> 00:10:37.308
Wake Miss Cora and Miss Alice, but do not make any noise.

00:10:37.368 --> 00:10:40.220
Duncan went to the back of the cave.

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:41.310
Cora.

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.612
Alice, he said quietly.

00:10:43.672 --> 00:10:45.073
Wake up.

00:10:45.133 --> 00:10:49.346
Suddenly there were shouts and cries outside.

00:10:49.406 --> 00:10:52.489
Duncan ran to the front of the cave.

00:10:52.549 --> 00:10:55.972
The sound of guns came from the forest.

00:10:56.032 --> 00:10:59.626
There were many Indians on the other side of the river.

00:10:59.686 --> 00:11:02.618
Churans thought Duncan.

00:11:02.678 --> 00:11:05.470
Then Duncan saw Hawkeye.

00:11:05.530 --> 00:11:08.964
The scout was shooting from the flat rock.

00:11:09.024 --> 00:11:13.298
Duncan saw a Huron fall into the rushing water.

00:11:13.358 --> 00:11:17.994
Then the other Hurons ran back into the forest.

00:11:18.054 --> 00:11:21.306
Hawkeye came back into the cave.

00:11:21.366 --> 00:11:23.849
They have gone, he said.

00:11:23.909 --> 00:11:25.460
Will they come back?

00:11:25.520 --> 00:11:26.922
asked Duncan.

00:11:26.982 --> 00:11:30.735
Yes, they will come back, replied Hawkeye.

00:11:30.795 --> 00:11:35.680
Miss Cora and Miss Alice must stay here in the cave.

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:41.593
We will go to the rocks and wait for the Hurons.

00:11:41.653 --> 00:11:48.864
Duncan, Hawkeye, Onka, and Chingacuk sat with their guns.

00:11:48.924 --> 00:11:52.845
They sat behind some rocks near the waterfall.

00:11:52.905 --> 00:11:54.545
They waited.

00:11:54.605 --> 00:11:56.686
Minutes passed.

00:11:56.746 --> 00:12:00.346
Then an hour passed.

00:12:00.406 --> 00:12:06.247
Suddenly they heard the wild cries of the Hurons again.

00:12:06.307 --> 00:12:11.092
Four Indians ran across the flat rock towards the cave.

00:12:11.152 --> 00:12:15.348
Jengachguk and Unkas fired their guns.

00:12:15.408 --> 00:12:19.700
The first two Hurons fell to the ground.

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:23.492
The third Huron jumped on Hawkeye.

00:12:23.552 --> 00:12:29.355
Each man had a knife, but Hawkeye was stronger than the Huron.

00:12:29.415 --> 00:12:33.137
He killed the Huron with his knife.

00:12:33.196 --> 00:12:36.708
The fourth Huron fought with Duncan.

00:12:36.768 --> 00:12:39.796
Unkas ran to help the officer.

00:12:39.856 --> 00:12:43.164
The young Mohican killed the Huron.

00:12:43.224 --> 00:12:47.506
Then Unca and Duncan ran back to the rocks.

00:12:47.566 --> 00:12:52.640
The Hurons on the other side of the river started to shoot again.

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:56.002
And Chingachco shot at them.

00:12:56.062 --> 00:12:59.283
The shooting went on and on.

00:12:59.343 --> 00:13:08.924
Rocks and trees near the cave were broken in a hundred places, but Hawkeye and his friends were not hurt.

00:13:08.984 --> 00:13:13.962
and Cora and Alice were safe in the cave.

00:13:14.022 --> 00:13:19.176
Hawkeye saw a Huron in a tree on the other side of the river.

00:13:19.236 --> 00:13:23.079
The scout lifted his long gum and fire.

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:28.134
There was a cry and the Indian fell from the tree.

00:13:28.194 --> 00:13:31.926
I have no more bullets, said Hawkeye.

00:13:31.986 --> 00:13:34.558
Honkas, go to the canoe.

00:13:34.618 --> 00:13:37.465
There are some bullets in the canoe.

00:13:37.525 --> 00:13:43.334
Ounkas ran quickly across the flat rock, but he was too late.

00:13:43.394 --> 00:13:48.938
A Huron was pushing the canoe across the river.

00:13:48.998 --> 00:13:55.864
Duncan, Hawkeye and the two Mohicans went back to the cave.

00:13:55.924 --> 00:13:57.795
What can we do now?

00:13:57.855 --> 00:13:59.396
Asked Duncan.

00:13:59.456 --> 00:14:02.338
Hawkeye thought for a few minutes.

00:14:02.398 --> 00:14:06.082
There will be guards on the paths, he said.

00:14:06.142 --> 00:14:09.215
The Hurons will watch every path.

00:14:09.275 --> 00:14:11.076
We must swim.

00:14:11.136 --> 00:14:13.418
We must jump into the river.

00:14:13.478 --> 00:14:17.990
The rushing water will take us past the Hurons.

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:21.632
The scout looked at Cora and Alice.

00:14:21.692 --> 00:14:25.054
We cannot swim, said Cora.

00:14:25.114 --> 00:14:27.916
Alice and I will stay here.

00:14:27.976 --> 00:14:31.819
Go to General Monroe at Fort William Henry.

00:14:31.879 --> 00:14:35.963
General Monroe must send soldiers.

00:14:36.023 --> 00:14:41.848
Chingacuk, Unkus and Hawkeye talked quietly together.

00:14:41.908 --> 00:14:47.130
Then Chingacuk ran out of the cave and jumped into the river.

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:52.944
A moment later Hawkeye put down his long gun and followed Chingacuk.

00:14:53.004 --> 00:14:56.996
The rushing water took them away.

00:14:57.056 --> 00:15:00.068
Cora looked at Unkus.

00:15:00.128 --> 00:15:02.410
Go with them, she said.

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:05.554
I will stay, said the young Mohican.

00:15:05.614 --> 00:15:06.556
No!

00:15:06.616 --> 00:15:07.517
said Cora.

00:15:07.578 --> 00:15:08.969
Please, Onkas.

00:15:09.028 --> 00:15:10.830
Go with them.

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:15.904
Onkas was unhappy, but he jumped into the water, too.

00:15:15.964 --> 00:15:18.316
Cora looked at Duncan.

00:15:18.376 --> 00:15:21.228
I am going to stay, said Duncan.

00:15:21.288 --> 00:15:22.890
He looked at Alice.

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:26.852
I cannot leave you.

00:15:26.912 --> 00:15:32.798
There were shouts and cries from the heurons on the flat rock.

00:15:32.858 --> 00:15:35.416
Duncan looked out of the cave.

00:15:35.476 --> 00:15:39.704
The heurons were looking behind the rocks near the waterfall.

00:15:39.764 --> 00:15:42.784
They are looking for us, thought Duncan.

00:15:42.844 --> 00:15:45.925
He went quickly back into the cave.

00:15:45.985 --> 00:15:51.016
Our friends will bring help soon, he said to Cora and Alice.

00:15:51.076 --> 00:15:53.106
Cora was afraid.

00:15:53.166 --> 00:15:55.057
Her face was white.

00:15:55.117 --> 00:15:56.437
She cried out.

00:15:56.497 --> 00:16:01.668
Duncan turned, and he saw the terrible face of Magua.

00:16:01.728 --> 00:16:05.394
Where are the Mohicans, asked Magua?

00:16:05.454 --> 00:16:10.264
Where is the scout, Hawkeye, the long gun?

00:16:10.324 --> 00:16:14.118
Suddenly the cave was full of neurons.

00:16:14.178 --> 00:16:16.921
One of them picked up Hawkeye's gun.

00:16:16.980 --> 00:16:19.542
They have gone, said Duncan.

00:16:19.602 --> 00:16:22.165
They will bring help soon.

00:16:22.225 --> 00:16:24.788
The neurons were angry.

00:16:24.848 --> 00:16:27.400
They were going to kill their prisoners.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:31.474
But Magua spoke to them quickly and quietly.

00:16:31.534 --> 00:16:37.538
Then the Hurons took Duncan, Cora and Alice to the flat rock.

00:16:37.598 --> 00:16:40.330
One of the Hurons brought the canoe.

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:44.782
Get into the canoe, Magua said.

00:16:44.842 --> 00:16:48.763
Duncan and the sisters got into the canoe.

00:16:48.823 --> 00:16:53.014
Magua and the Hurons took them across the river.

00:16:53.074 --> 00:16:57.786
The prisoners got out of the canoe on the other side of the river.

00:16:57.846 --> 00:17:01.498
Magua and five Hurons stayed with them.

00:17:01.558 --> 00:17:12.075
The other heurons walked away into the forest.

00:17:12.136 --> 00:17:29.180
Chapter 3 The fight at Glen's Falls Hawkeye woke Duncan early the next morning.

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:31.426
We must go, he said.

00:17:31.486 --> 00:17:33.373
I will get the canoe.

00:17:33.433 --> 00:17:39.238
Wake Miss Cora and Miss Alice, but do not make any noise.

00:17:39.298 --> 00:17:42.149
Duncan went to the back of the cave.

00:17:42.209 --> 00:17:43.240
Cora.

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:45.542
Alice, he said quietly.

00:17:45.602 --> 00:17:47.032
Wake up.

00:17:47.092 --> 00:17:51.306
Suddenly there were shouts and cries outside.

00:17:51.366 --> 00:17:54.448
Duncan ran to the front of the cave.

00:17:54.508 --> 00:17:57.920
The sound of guns came from the forest.

00:17:57.980 --> 00:18:01.566
There were many Indians on the other side of the river.

00:18:01.625 --> 00:18:04.541
Turons, thought Duncan.

00:18:04.601 --> 00:18:07.404
Then Duncan saw Hawkeye.

00:18:07.464 --> 00:18:10.876
The scout was shooting from the flat rock.

00:18:10.936 --> 00:18:15.250
Duncan saw a Huron fall into the rushing water.

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:19.953
Then the other Hurons ran back into the forest.

00:18:20.014 --> 00:18:23.256
Hawkeye came back into the cave.

00:18:23.316 --> 00:18:25.798
They have gone, he said.

00:18:25.858 --> 00:18:27.409
Will they come back?

00:18:27.469 --> 00:18:28.844
Asked Duncan.

00:18:28.904 --> 00:18:32.669
Yes, they will come back, replied Hawkeye.

00:18:32.729 --> 00:18:37.610
Miss Cora and Miss Alice must stay here in the cave.

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:43.511
We will go to the rocks and wait for the heroes.

00:18:43.572 --> 00:18:50.803
Duncan, Hawkeye, Onka, and Chingotchkook sat with their guns.

00:18:50.863 --> 00:18:54.824
They sat behind some rocks near the waterfall.

00:18:54.884 --> 00:18:56.474
They waited.

00:18:56.534 --> 00:18:58.628
Minutes passed.

00:18:58.688 --> 00:19:02.284
than an hour passed.

00:19:02.344 --> 00:19:08.186
Suddenly they heard the wild cries of the Hurons again.

00:19:08.246 --> 00:19:13.039
Four Indians ran across the flat rock towards the cave.

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:17.291
Chingacuk and Unkas fired their guns.

00:19:17.352 --> 00:19:21.654
The first two Hurons fell to the ground.

00:19:21.714 --> 00:19:25.446
The third Huron jumped on Hawkeye.

00:19:25.506 --> 00:19:27.892
Each man had a knife.

00:19:27.952 --> 00:19:31.299
but Hawkeye was stronger than the Huron.

00:19:31.359 --> 00:19:35.070
He killed the Huron with his knife.

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:38.591
The fourth Huron fought with Duncan.

00:19:38.651 --> 00:19:41.752
Bunkas ran to help the officer.

00:19:41.812 --> 00:19:45.093
The young Mohican killed the Huron.

00:19:45.153 --> 00:19:49.454
Then Bunkas and Duncan ran back to the rocks.

00:19:49.514 --> 00:19:54.586
The Hurons on the other side of the river started to shoot again.

00:19:54.646 --> 00:19:57.930
And Chingachco shot at them.

00:19:57.990 --> 00:20:01.226
The shooting went on and on.

00:20:01.286 --> 00:20:10.852
Rocks and trees near the cave were broken in a hundred places, but Hawkeye and his friends were not hurt.

00:20:10.913 --> 00:20:15.916
And Cora and Alice were safe in the cave.

00:20:15.976 --> 00:20:21.130
Hawkeye saw a Huron in a tree on the other side of the river.

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:25.022
The scout lifted his long gun and fired.

00:20:25.082 --> 00:20:26.794
There was a cry.

00:20:26.854 --> 00:20:30.056
and the Indian fell from the tree.

00:20:30.116 --> 00:20:33.920
I have no more bullets, Zenhokai.

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:36.482
Onkas, go to the canoe.

00:20:36.542 --> 00:20:39.434
There are some bullets in the canoe.

00:20:39.494 --> 00:20:45.279
Onkas ran quickly across the flat rock, but he was too late.

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:50.866
A Huron was pushing the canoe across the river.

00:20:50.926 --> 00:20:57.784
Duncan, Hawkeye, and the two Mohicans went back to the cave.

00:20:57.844 --> 00:20:59.725
What can we do now?"

00:20:59.785 --> 00:21:01.336
asked Duncan.

00:21:01.396 --> 00:21:04.268
Hawkeye thought for a few minutes.

00:21:04.328 --> 00:21:08.042
There will be guards on the paths, he said.

00:21:08.102 --> 00:21:11.174
The Hurons will watch every path.

00:21:11.234 --> 00:21:13.026
We must swim.

00:21:13.086 --> 00:21:15.368
We must jump into the river.

00:21:15.428 --> 00:21:19.943
The rushing water will take us past the Hurons.

00:21:20.004 --> 00:21:23.576
The scout looked at Cora and Alice.

00:21:23.636 --> 00:21:26.986
We cannot swim, said Cora.

00:21:27.046 --> 00:21:29.847
Alice and I will stay here.

00:21:29.907 --> 00:21:33.757
Go to General Monroe at Fort William Henry.

00:21:33.817 --> 00:21:37.898
General Monroe must send soldiers.

00:21:37.958 --> 00:21:43.799
Jengachkuk, Unkus and Hawkeye talked quietly together.

00:21:43.859 --> 00:21:49.052
Then Jengachkuk ran out of the cave and jumped into the river.

00:21:49.112 --> 00:21:54.876
A moment later, Hawkeye put down his long gun and followed Chingachku.

00:21:54.936 --> 00:21:58.926
The rushing water took them away.

00:21:58.986 --> 00:22:01.997
Cora looked at Unkas.

00:22:02.057 --> 00:22:04.338
Go with them, she said.

00:22:04.398 --> 00:22:07.478
I will stay, said the young Mohican.

00:22:07.538 --> 00:22:09.459
No, said Cora.

00:22:09.519 --> 00:22:12.769
Please, Unkas, go with them.

00:22:12.829 --> 00:22:17.813
Unkas was unhappy, but he jumped into the water, too.

00:22:17.873 --> 00:22:20.246
Cora looked at Duncan.

00:22:20.306 --> 00:22:23.157
I am going to stay, said Duncan.

00:22:23.217 --> 00:22:24.817
He looked at Alice.

00:22:24.877 --> 00:22:28.778
I cannot leave you."

00:22:28.838 --> 00:22:34.719
There were shouts and cries from the Hurons on the flat rock.

00:22:34.779 --> 00:22:37.350
Duncan looked out of the cave.

00:22:37.410 --> 00:22:41.661
The Hurons were looking behind the rocks near the waterfall.

00:22:41.721 --> 00:22:44.731
They are looking for us, thought Duncan.

00:22:44.792 --> 00:22:47.860
He went quickly back into the cave.

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:52.970
Our friends will bring help soon," he said to Cora and Alice.

00:22:53.030 --> 00:22:55.042
Cora was afraid.

00:22:55.102 --> 00:22:57.003
Her face was white.

00:22:57.063 --> 00:22:58.394
She cried out.

00:22:58.454 --> 00:23:03.627
Duncan turned, and he saw the terrible face of Magua.

00:23:03.687 --> 00:23:07.350
Where are the Mohicans, asked Magua?

00:23:07.410 --> 00:23:12.222
Where is the scout, Hawkeye, the long gun?

00:23:12.282 --> 00:23:16.058
Suddenly the cave was full of neurons.

00:23:16.118 --> 00:23:18.853
One of them picked up Hawkeye's gun.

00:23:18.913 --> 00:23:21.464
They have gone, said Duncan.

00:23:21.524 --> 00:23:24.075
They will bring help soon.

00:23:24.135 --> 00:23:26.716
The Hurons were angry.

00:23:26.776 --> 00:23:29.327
They were going to kill their prisoners.

00:23:29.387 --> 00:23:33.409
But Magua spoke to them quickly and quietly.

00:23:33.469 --> 00:23:39.492
Then the Hurons took Duncan, Cora and Alice to the flat rock.

00:23:39.552 --> 00:23:42.272
One of the Hurons brought the canoe.

00:23:42.332 --> 00:23:46.720
Get into the canoe, Magua said.

00:23:46.780 --> 00:23:50.707
Duncan and the sisters got into the canoe.

00:23:50.767 --> 00:23:54.949
Magua and the Hurans took them across the river.

00:23:55.009 --> 00:23:59.720
The prisoners got out of the canoe on the other side of the river.

00:23:59.780 --> 00:24:03.452
Magua and five Hurans stayed with them.

00:24:03.512 --> 00:24:13.963
The other Hurans walked away into the forest.

00:24:14.023 --> 00:24:30.009
Chapter 4 I Am a Huron Chief The Hurons and their prisoners started to walk.

