00:27:17.443 --> 00:27:19.624
"'What did Magua say to you?'

00:27:19.644 --> 00:27:22.985
"'It is not important,' said Cora.

00:27:23.005 --> 00:27:26.726
"'The heurons were listening to Magua.

00:27:26.786 --> 00:27:28.667
Duncan watched them.

00:27:28.727 --> 00:27:30.738
They were very angry.

00:27:30.798 --> 00:27:34.048
Suddenly Magua shouted at the heurons.

00:27:34.108 --> 00:27:38.030
They pulled Duncan and the women towards the trees.

00:27:38.090 --> 00:27:42.670
They tied each prisoner to a tree with rope.

00:27:42.731 --> 00:27:46.181
Magua stood in front of Cora.

00:27:46.241 --> 00:27:47.581
He laughed.

00:27:47.641 --> 00:27:51.172
What does Monroe's daughter say now?

00:27:51.232 --> 00:27:52.233
He said.

00:27:52.293 --> 00:27:55.854
Shall I send your sister to your father?

00:27:55.914 --> 00:28:01.006
Will you follow me to the Great Lakes and live with me?

00:28:01.066 --> 00:28:03.666
Cora looked at her sister.

00:28:03.726 --> 00:28:05.867
Alice said Cora.

00:28:05.927 --> 00:28:09.568
I must go with Magua and be his wife.

00:28:09.628 --> 00:28:12.555
Then you and Duncan will live.

00:28:12.615 --> 00:28:13.681
"'No!'

00:28:13.741 --> 00:28:14.672
