00:28:14.692 --> 00:28:15.432
"'Never!'

00:28:15.452 --> 00:28:17.613
"'No, no, no!'

00:28:17.673 --> 00:28:18.353
said Alice.

00:28:18.373 --> 00:28:20.224
"'Then die!'

00:28:20.284 --> 00:28:21.684
