00:28:21.744 --> 00:28:24.196
He threw his knife at Alice.

00:28:24.256 --> 00:28:27.117
The knife caught off some of her hair.

00:28:27.177 --> 00:28:29.968
It hit the tree above her head.

00:28:30.028 --> 00:28:32.669
Duncan shouted angrily.

00:28:32.729 --> 00:28:39.002
