00:28:39.062 --> 00:28:42.352
He jumped on a Huron and they fought.

00:28:42.412 --> 00:28:44.520
The Huron had a knife.

00:28:44.580 --> 00:28:47.351
He was going to kill Duncan.

00:28:47.411 --> 00:29:00.094
