00:33:47.450 --> 00:33:56.588
Chapter 5.

00:33:56.648 --> 00:34:03.680
Fort William Henry Hawkeye ran from the forest.

00:34:03.740 --> 00:34:06.641
Chingotch Cook and Unchus followed him.

00:34:06.701 --> 00:34:08.171
There was a fight.

00:34:08.231 --> 00:34:12.552
Hawkeye, Unchus and Duncan killed four Hurons.

00:34:12.612 --> 00:34:15.123
Chingaczuk jumped on Magua.

00:34:15.183 --> 00:34:18.235
The Malikans stabbed Magua with his knife.

00:34:18.295 --> 00:34:20.986
Magua fell to the ground.

00:34:21.046 --> 00:34:25.358
Hawkeye and Duncan went and helped the two women.

00:34:25.419 --> 00:34:28.030
But Magua was not dead.

00:34:28.090 --> 00:34:30.641
He got up and ran away.

00:34:30.701 --> 00:34:34.083
Chingaczuk and Unka's ran after him.

00:34:34.143 --> 00:34:35.184
Stop!

00:34:35.244 --> 00:34:36.484
shouted Hawkeye.

00:34:36.544 --> 00:34:38.585
You cannot catch him!

00:34:38.646 --> 00:34:41.959
Hawkeye, how did you find us?

00:34:42.019 --> 00:34:43.552
Duncan asked.

00:34:43.612 --> 00:34:47.413
We waited at the side of the river, said Hawkeye.

00:34:47.473 --> 00:34:51.274
We saw the Hurons take you across the river.

00:34:51.335 --> 00:34:53.055
Then we followed you.

00:34:53.115 --> 00:34:56.426
You saved my life, said Duncan.

00:34:56.486 --> 00:34:58.237
Hawkeye smiled.

00:34:58.297 --> 00:35:01.588
I found a Huron's gun, he said.

00:35:01.649 --> 00:35:03.890
The Hurons were stupid.

00:35:03.950 --> 00:35:07.740
They left their guns under the trees.

00:35:07.801 --> 00:35:10.908
Hawkeye went back to the trees.

00:35:10.968 --> 00:35:13.304
He picked up the other guns.

00:35:13.364 --> 00:35:16.234
He found his own long gun.

00:35:16.294 --> 00:35:19.905
Now we have guns and bullets, he said.

00:35:19.965 --> 00:35:22.176
We will stay here tonight.

00:35:22.236 --> 00:35:28.047
Tomorrow we will go to Fort William Henry.

00:35:28.108 --> 00:35:34.779
Very early the next morning, Hawkeye woke his friends.

00:35:34.839 --> 00:35:39.668
He led them across the valley and along a path through the forest.

00:35:39.728 --> 00:35:42.736
They stopped near a small river.

00:35:42.796 --> 00:35:46.257
We will walk in the water, said Hawkeye.

00:35:46.317 --> 00:35:50.599
Then Magua will not see our footprints on the ground.

00:35:50.659 --> 00:35:54.080
They walked in the river for an hour.

00:35:54.140 --> 00:35:56.672
Then they came to some mountains.

00:35:56.732 --> 00:35:59.732
Walk quietly now, said Hawkeye.

