00:36:19.910 --> 00:36:22.512
There are many heurons in the forest.

00:36:22.572 --> 00:36:24.883
They are fighting for the French.

00:36:24.943 --> 00:36:27.574
And look to the west, said Duncan.

00:36:27.634 --> 00:36:29.336
Look at those tents.

