Follow me.

00:36:57.645 --> 00:37:02.758
Hawkeye and the Mohicans started to walk down the mountain.

00:37:02.818 --> 00:37:06.130
Duncan and the two sisters followed them.

00:37:06.190 --> 00:37:10.726
At the bottom of the mountain, The fog was very thick.

00:37:10.786 --> 00:37:13.187
Be careful, said Hawkeye.

00:37:13.247 --> 00:37:16.638
There are many French soldiers along this path.

00:37:16.698 --> 00:37:19.139
Walk quietly.

00:37:19.199 --> 00:37:22.090
They followed him through the fog.

00:37:22.150 --> 00:37:24.630
Suddenly they heard voices.

00:37:24.690 --> 00:37:26.161
Who is there?

00:37:26.221 --> 00:37:28.312
Said a soldier in French.

00:37:28.372 --> 00:37:31.322
Duncan replied in French.

00:37:31.382 --> 00:37:34.493
A friend of France, he said.

00:37:34.553 --> 00:37:36.124
Who are you?

00:37:36.184 --> 00:37:37.826
Shouted the Frenchman.

00:37:37.886 --> 00:37:42.179
But Duncan and his friends walked away quickly.

00:37:42.240 --> 00:37:44.840
They went on through the fog.

00:37:44.900 --> 00:37:49.042
At last, they arrived at the walls of the fort.

00:37:49.102 --> 00:37:53.164
An English voice shouted from the top of the wall.

00:37:53.224 --> 00:37:54.604
The French are here!

00:37:54.665 --> 00:37:55.385
Shoot!

00:37:55.445 --> 00:37:56.435
Shoot!

00:37:56.495 --> 00:37:57.716
Father!

00:37:57.776 --> 00:37:58.516
Father!

00:37:58.536 --> 00:37:59.627
I'll have shouted.

00:37:59.687 --> 00:38:00.657
It is us!

00:38:00.717 --> 00:38:02.297
Save your daughters!

00:38:02.358 --> 00:38:03.848
Don't shoot men!

00:38:03.908 --> 00:38:05.775
Said the voice of General Monroe.

00:38:05.836 --> 00:38:07.203
My daughters are here!

00:38:07.264 --> 00:38:09.056
Open the gates!

00:38:09.116 --> 00:38:11.138
The gates opened.

00:38:11.198 --> 00:38:13.522
Soldiers came out of the fort.

00:38:13.582 --> 00:38:16.034
They took everybody inside.

00:38:16.094 --> 00:38:20.970
Duncan, the young women, Hawkeye, and the Mohicans.

00:38:21.030 --> 00:38:33.828
But everybody in Fort William Henry was in danger.

00:38:33.888 --> 00:38:43.450
Chapter 5.

00:38:43.510 --> 00:38:50.533
Fort William Henry Hawkeye ran from the forest.

00:38:50.593 --> 00:38:53.494
Chingacchguk and Unkus followed him.

00:38:53.554 --> 00:38:55.034
There was a fight.

00:38:55.094 --> 00:38:59.396
Hawkeye, Unkus and Duncan killed four Hurons.

00:38:59.456 --> 00:39:01.997
Chingacchguk jumped on Magua.

00:39:02.057 --> 00:39:05.088
The Mohican stabbed Magua with his knife.

00:39:05.148 --> 00:39:07.858
Magua fell to the ground.

00:39:07.918 --> 00:39:12.217
Hawkeye and Duncan went and helped the two women.

00:39:12.278 --> 00:39:14.886
But Magua was not dead.

00:39:14.946 --> 00:39:17.488
He got up and ran away.

00:39:17.548 --> 00:39:20.930
Chingachguk and Unka's ran after him.

00:39:20.990 --> 00:39:22.040
Stop!

00:39:22.100 --> 00:39:23.332
shouted Hawkeye.

00:39:23.392 --> 00:39:25.432
You cannot catch him!

00:39:25.493 --> 00:39:28.824
Hawkeye, how did you find us?

00:39:28.884 --> 00:39:30.416
Duncan asked.

00:39:30.476 --> 00:39:34.288
We waited at the side of the river, said Hawkeye.

00:39:34.348 --> 00:39:38.150
We saw the Hurons take you across the river.

00:39:38.210 --> 00:39:39.914
Then we followed you.

00:39:39.974 --> 00:39:43.279
You saved my life," said Duncan.

00:39:43.339 --> 00:39:45.090
Hawkeye smiled.

00:39:45.150 --> 00:39:48.441
I found a Huron's gun, he said.

00:39:48.501 --> 00:39:50.742
The Hurons were stupid.

00:39:50.802 --> 00:39:54.602
They left their guns under the trees.

00:39:54.662 --> 00:39:57.834
Hawkeye went back to the trees.

00:39:57.894 --> 00:40:00.175
He picked up the other guns.

00:40:00.235 --> 00:40:03.105
He found his own long gun.

00:40:03.166 --> 00:40:06.767
Now we have guns and bullets, he said.

00:40:06.827 --> 00:40:09.038
We will stay here tonight.

00:40:09.098 --> 00:40:14.892
Tomorrow We will go to Fort William Henry.

00:40:14.953 --> 00:40:21.634
Very early the next morning, Hawkeye woke his friends.

00:40:21.694 --> 00:40:26.525
He led them across the valley and along a path through the forest.

00:40:26.585 --> 00:40:29.595
They stopped near a small river.

00:40:29.655 --> 00:40:33.106
We will walk in the water, said Hawkeye.

00:40:33.166 --> 00:40:37.467
Then Magua will not see our footprints on the ground.

00:40:37.527 --> 00:40:40.930
They walked in the river for an hour.

00:40:40.990 --> 00:40:43.531
Then they came to some mountains.

00:40:43.591 --> 00:40:46.581
Walk quietly now, said Hawkeye.

00:40:46.641 --> 00:40:49.282
There are French soldiers here.

00:40:49.342 --> 00:40:53.752
They walked to the top of a mountain and looked down.

00:40:53.812 --> 00:40:58.943
There was Lake Horakin, and there was Fort William Henry.

00:40:59.003 --> 00:41:03.124
Smoke came from fires in the forest.

00:41:03.184 --> 00:41:06.705
Look at the fires, said Hawkeye.

00:41:06.765 --> 00:41:09.352
There are many heurons in the forest.

00:41:09.412 --> 00:41:11.730
They are fighting for the French.

00:41:11.790 --> 00:41:14.431
And look to the west, said Duncan.

00:41:14.491 --> 00:41:16.192
Look at those tents.

00:41:16.252 --> 00:41:19.092
That is General Montcom's camp.

00:41:19.152 --> 00:41:22.424
There are thousands of French soldiers.

00:41:22.484 --> 00:41:26.134
Suddenly they heard the sound of guns.

00:41:26.194 --> 00:41:31.136
The French are shooting at Fort William Henry, said Duncan.

00:41:31.196 --> 00:41:33.876
But we must get into the fort.

00:41:33.937 --> 00:41:36.227
We are lucky, said Hawkeye.

00:41:36.287 --> 00:41:39.258
Thick fog is coming along the valley.

00:41:39.318 --> 00:41:42.490
The fog will hide us from the French.

00:41:42.550 --> 00:41:44.422
Follow me!

00:41:44.482 --> 00:41:49.604
Hawkeye and the Mohicans started to walk down the mountain.

00:41:49.665 --> 00:41:52.986
Duncan and the two sisters followed them.

00:41:53.047 --> 00:41:57.590
At the bottom of the mountain, the fog was very thick.

00:41:57.650 --> 00:42:00.052
Be careful, said Hawkeye.

00:42:00.112 --> 00:42:03.504
There are many French soldiers along this path.

00:42:03.564 --> 00:42:06.011
Walk quietly.

00:42:06.071 --> 00:42:08.938
They followed him through the fog.

00:42:08.998 --> 00:42:11.489
Suddenly they heard voices.

00:42:11.549 --> 00:42:13.020
Who is there?

00:42:13.080 --> 00:42:15.170
Said a soldier in French.

00:42:15.230 --> 00:42:18.182
Duncan replied in French.

00:42:18.242 --> 00:42:21.363
A friend of France, he said.

00:42:21.423 --> 00:42:22.984
Who are you?

00:42:23.044 --> 00:42:24.694
shouted the Frenchman.

00:42:24.754 --> 00:42:29.056
But Duncan and his friends walked away quickly.

00:42:29.116 --> 00:42:31.717
They went on through the fog.

00:42:31.778 --> 00:42:35.906
At last they arrived at the walls of the fort.

00:42:35.966 --> 00:42:40.013
An English voice shouted from the top of the wall.

00:42:40.073 --> 00:42:41.453
The French are here!

00:42:41.513 --> 00:42:42.233
Shoot!

00:42:42.293 --> 00:42:43.293
Shoot!

00:42:43.353 --> 00:42:44.574
Father!

00:42:44.634 --> 00:42:45.524
Father!

00:42:45.584 --> 00:42:46.474
Alice shouted.

00:42:46.534 --> 00:42:47.504
It is us!

00:42:47.564 --> 00:42:49.155
Save your daughters!

00:42:49.215 --> 00:42:50.695
Don't shoot men!

00:42:50.755 --> 00:42:52.645
Said the voice of General Monroe.

00:42:52.705 --> 00:42:54.066
My daughters are here!

00:42:54.126 --> 00:42:55.926
Open the gates!

00:42:55.986 --> 00:42:57.986
The gates opened.

00:42:58.046 --> 00:43:00.377
Soldiers came out of the fort.

00:43:00.437 --> 00:43:02.877
They took everybody inside.

00:43:02.937 --> 00:43:08.428
Duncan, the young women, Hawkeye, and the Mohicans.

00:43:08.468 --> 00:43:24.116
But everybody in Fort William Henry was in danger.

00:43:24.176 --> 00:43:40.214
The French army fired their big guns at Fort William Henry.

00:43:40.274 --> 00:43:43.465
Many English soldiers were killed.

00:43:43.525 --> 00:43:50.438
General Monroe waited, but General Webb did not send any soldiers.

00:43:50.498 --> 00:43:54.999
Monroe sent Hawkeye to Fort Edward with a message.

00:43:55.059 --> 00:43:59.200
General Webb gave Hawkeye a letter for Monroe.

00:43:59.260 --> 00:44:06.004
The scout started to go back to Fort William Henry, but French soldiers stopped him.

00:44:06.065 --> 00:44:08.098
They took the letter.

00:44:08.158 --> 00:44:11.890
They tied Hawkeye's hands with rope.

00:44:11.950 --> 00:44:18.393
The next morning Duncan Hayward was standing by the gates of Fort William Henry.

00:44:18.454 --> 00:44:22.196
He saw three men coming towards the fort.

00:44:22.256 --> 00:44:24.518
He went to General Monroe.

00:44:24.578 --> 00:44:30.060
General Monroe, he said, two French soldiers are at the gates of the fort.

00:44:30.120 --> 00:44:35.364
Hawkeye is with them, but when will help come from Fort Edward?

00:44:35.424 --> 00:44:39.184
Hawkeye came into General Monroe's room.

00:44:39.245 --> 00:44:42.895
General Webb gave me a letter for you, he said.

00:44:42.955 --> 00:44:45.306
But the French soldiers took it.

00:44:45.366 --> 00:44:48.146
General Montgomery wants to speak to you.

00:44:48.206 --> 00:44:51.427
You must go to his camp.

00:44:51.487 --> 00:44:57.608
A French officer met Monroe and Duncan at the gates of the fort.

00:44:57.668 --> 00:45:01.959
They went to General Montgomery's tent in the French camp.

00:45:02.019 --> 00:45:06.329
There were French officers and Indian chiefs in the tent.

00:45:06.389 --> 00:45:09.060
Then Duncan saw Magua.

00:45:09.120 --> 00:45:12.442
Magua was fighting for the French.

00:45:12.502 --> 00:45:16.946
The Huron looked at Duncan and smiled.

00:45:17.006 --> 00:45:19.697
Mancarm spoke first.

00:45:19.758 --> 00:45:21.638
He spoke to Monroe.

00:45:21.698 --> 00:45:25.102
You had fought well, General, he said.

00:45:25.162 --> 00:45:28.333
But now you must stop fighting.

00:45:28.394 --> 00:45:31.376
Mancarm gave a letter to Monroe.

00:45:31.436 --> 00:45:33.608
Monroe read it quickly.

00:45:33.668 --> 00:45:35.964
Then he gave it to Duncan.

00:45:36.024 --> 00:45:38.972
The letter was from General Webb.

00:45:39.033 --> 00:45:44.106
The letter said, We cannot send any more men.

00:45:44.167 --> 00:45:48.970
The Indians have killed too many of my soldiers.

00:45:49.030 --> 00:45:51.762
Monroe looked at Duncan.

00:45:51.822 --> 00:45:54.074
They did not speak.

00:45:54.134 --> 00:45:57.618
Then General Moncam spoke to Monroe.

00:45:57.678 --> 00:46:02.732
You and your soldiers must leave thought William Henry, he said.

00:46:02.792 --> 00:46:04.920
You can take your guns.

00:46:04.980 --> 00:46:07.489
but do not take your bullets.

00:46:07.549 --> 00:46:15.642
Your men, women, and children will be safe, but we will burn the fort."

00:46:15.702 --> 00:46:18.214
General Monroe was unhappy.

00:46:18.234 --> 00:46:21.625
"'We will leave in the morning,' he said.

00:46:21.685 --> 00:46:25.987
Then he and Duncan went back to the fort.

00:46:26.047 --> 00:46:28.398
Magua was angry.

00:46:28.458 --> 00:46:30.759
He spoke to the Huron Chiefs.

00:46:30.819 --> 00:46:33.549
The English will leave the fort.

00:46:33.610 --> 00:46:39.971
The French will not kill them, but the English are the enemies of the Hurons.

00:46:40.031 --> 00:46:43.672
We will kill the English.

00:46:43.732 --> 00:46:51.624
Three thousand English people, soldiers, women and children, left the fort.

00:46:51.684 --> 00:46:57.286
They walked past the French soldiers, and they walked towards the forest.

00:46:57.346 --> 00:47:05.032
The English soldiers carried their guns, but they had no bullets.

00:47:05.092 --> 00:47:11.350
Magua and the Hurans were standing in the forest.

00:47:11.410 --> 00:47:14.111
They watched Fort William Henry.

00:47:14.171 --> 00:47:18.884
The English left the fort and walked into the forest.

00:47:18.944 --> 00:47:24.026
Then two thousand Indians attacked.

00:47:24.086 --> 00:47:26.947
The English could not fight.

00:47:27.008 --> 00:47:29.858
They had no bullets in their guns.

00:47:29.918 --> 00:47:33.760
Many of the English were killed.

00:47:33.820 --> 00:47:36.969
Alice and Cora saw their father.

00:47:37.029 --> 00:47:39.778
He was running towards the French camp.

00:47:39.838 --> 00:47:42.230
He was going to find Munkam.

00:47:42.290 --> 00:47:44.582
He was going to ask for help.

00:47:44.642 --> 00:47:45.764
Father!

00:47:45.824 --> 00:47:46.854
Father!

00:47:46.914 --> 00:47:47.985
Shouted Alice.

00:47:48.045 --> 00:47:49.636
We are here!

00:47:49.696 --> 00:47:52.439
But Monroe did not hear them.

00:47:52.499 --> 00:47:54.420
He did not stop.

00:47:54.480 --> 00:47:56.682
Maguire was watching.

00:47:56.743 --> 00:47:58.474
He ran to Cora.

00:47:58.534 --> 00:48:00.756
Will you come with me now?

00:48:00.816 --> 00:48:01.606
He said.

00:48:01.667 --> 00:48:03.428
Never said Cora.

00:48:03.488 --> 00:48:06.129
I will not be your wife.

00:48:06.189 --> 00:48:10.530
The Huron looked at her, but he did not speak.

00:48:10.590 --> 00:48:12.700
Then he turned to Alice.

00:48:12.760 --> 00:48:14.811
He held Alice's arms.

00:48:14.871 --> 00:48:17.152
He pulled her towards a horse.

00:48:17.212 --> 00:48:21.303
Stop, shouted Cora, and she ran after them.

00:48:21.363 --> 00:48:24.384
Magua put Alice on the horse.

00:48:24.444 --> 00:48:27.265
Then he put Cora on the horse, too.

00:48:27.325 --> 00:48:46.656
The Huron took them along a path towards Lake Horakin.

00:48:46.716 --> 00:49:08.400
Chapter 7 The Trail Three days had passed.

00:49:08.460 --> 00:49:11.802
Fort William Henry had burnt down.

00:49:11.862 --> 00:49:14.364
The French soldiers had gone.

00:49:14.424 --> 00:49:16.585
The Indians had gone.

00:49:16.645 --> 00:49:23.608
The bodies of many English soldiers, women, and children lay on the ground.

00:49:23.668 --> 00:49:35.934
In the evening five men walked through the forest, Monroe Duncan, Hawkeye, Chingachguk and UNKUS were looking for Kora and Alice.

00:49:35.995 --> 00:49:39.857
They found the dead bodies of many English people.

00:49:39.917 --> 00:49:44.300
The five men were sad and angry.

00:49:44.360 --> 00:49:48.302
Suddenly UNKUS shouted to the others, look!

00:49:48.362 --> 00:49:51.894
He had a small piece of cloth in his hand.

00:49:51.955 --> 00:49:55.976
That is a piece of Kora's dress, said Monroe.

00:49:56.036 --> 00:50:00.012
UNKUS found footprints on the ground near a tree.

00:50:00.072 --> 00:50:04.386
Three people, and a horse, have stood here," he said.

00:50:04.446 --> 00:50:11.038
Then Chingacuk found Alice's necklace, and he found another piece of Korra's dress.

00:50:11.098 --> 00:50:13.429
Duncan took the necklace.

00:50:13.489 --> 00:50:14.889
He smiled.

00:50:14.949 --> 00:50:18.020
Alice is alive, he said.

00:50:18.080 --> 00:50:21.661
Miss Korra has left a trail, said Hawkeye.

00:50:21.721 --> 00:50:24.612
She has left pieces of her dress.

00:50:24.672 --> 00:50:29.301
We can follow this trail, but we must go quietly.

00:50:29.362 --> 00:50:31.521
Magua is with them.

00:50:31.581 --> 00:50:34.142
But it is late, said Hawkeye.

00:50:34.202 --> 00:50:36.082
We will eat some food.

00:50:36.143 --> 00:50:38.474
We will sleep here tonight.

00:50:38.534 --> 00:50:43.236
Tomorrow we will follow Miss Cora's trail."

00:50:43.296 --> 00:50:50.348
Very early the next morning, Hawkeye woke the English officers and the Mohicans.

00:50:50.408 --> 00:50:53.599
The five men followed Cora's trail.

00:50:53.659 --> 00:50:56.664
It led them to Lake Horakan.

00:50:56.724 --> 00:51:02.659
Bunkas and Chingachguk found a canoe in the grass near the lake.

00:51:02.720 --> 00:51:05.840
The five men got into the canoe.

00:51:05.900 --> 00:51:09.291
The Mohicans paddled it along the lake.

00:51:09.351 --> 00:51:13.232
After half an hour Bunkas spoke quietly.

00:51:13.292 --> 00:51:15.253
Smoke, he said.

00:51:15.313 --> 00:51:18.813
He was looking at a small island in front of them.

00:51:18.874 --> 00:51:24.877
Smoke from a fire said Hawkeye, and there are two canoes.

00:51:24.937 --> 00:51:29.160
Suddenly, some Huron's ran from the trees on the island.

00:51:29.220 --> 00:51:31.531
They got into the two canoes.

00:51:31.591 --> 00:51:33.821
They are following us, said Duncan.

00:51:33.881 --> 00:51:35.562
Taddled faster!

00:51:35.622 --> 00:51:39.213
No, stop paddling, Chingotch-gook, said Hawkeye.

00:51:39.273 --> 00:51:40.653
I will shoot them.

00:51:40.713 --> 00:51:43.344
And he lifted his long gun.

00:51:43.404 --> 00:51:45.374
He fired.

00:51:45.435 --> 00:51:49.326
A Huron in the first canoe fell into the lake.

00:51:49.386 --> 00:51:52.166
The Huron stopped their two canoes.

00:51:52.226 --> 00:51:54.474
They did not follow.

00:51:54.534 --> 00:51:58.622
Jengachguk and Unka started paddling again.

00:51:58.682 --> 00:52:00.964
The five men went on.

00:52:01.024 --> 00:52:09.398
They went north up the lake.

00:52:09.458 --> 00:52:16.652
Chapter 8.

00:52:16.712 --> 00:52:25.370
The Medicine Man In the evening, the five men arrived at the north end of Lake Horak.

00:52:25.430 --> 00:52:30.575
They got out of the canoe, and Unca San Chingachkuk carried it.

00:52:30.635 --> 00:52:33.276
They put it under some trees.

00:52:33.336 --> 00:52:36.548
We have lost the trail, said Duncan.

00:52:36.608 --> 00:52:38.459
Where shall we go?

00:52:38.519 --> 00:52:43.922
My Mohican friends know the path to the Huron's village, said Hawkeye.

00:52:43.982 --> 00:52:46.143
It is north of this place.

00:52:46.203 --> 00:52:48.954
That is where Magua is going.

00:52:49.014 --> 00:52:52.458
We will go north, too.

00:52:52.518 --> 00:52:57.052
For two days the men followed the path.

00:52:57.112 --> 00:52:59.673
They walked many miles.

00:52:59.733 --> 00:53:03.844
They arrived at the Huron's village on the second day.

00:53:03.904 --> 00:53:06.065
It was early evening.

00:53:06.125 --> 00:53:11.606
There were about a hundred houses by a small lake.

00:53:11.667 --> 00:53:16.348
Hawkeye spoke to Chingachkuk and Unkas.

00:53:16.408 --> 00:53:19.679
Then he spoke to Duncan and Monroe.

00:53:19.740 --> 00:53:24.339
General Monroe, stay with Chingachkuk, said Hawkeye.

00:53:24.399 --> 00:53:26.318
Stay in the forest.

00:53:26.379 --> 00:53:29.550
Duncan and I will go into the village.

00:53:29.610 --> 00:53:32.923
Uncas, go up the hill to the west.

00:53:32.983 --> 00:53:34.814
Watch the village.

00:53:34.874 --> 00:53:36.565
Come back quickly.

00:53:36.626 --> 00:53:39.698
Tell us about the guards.

00:53:39.758 --> 00:53:42.520
An hour passed.

00:53:42.580 --> 00:53:44.892
The four men waited.

00:53:44.952 --> 00:53:48.154
Uncas did not come back.

00:53:48.214 --> 00:53:50.606
Suddenly Duncan spoke.

00:53:50.666 --> 00:53:52.828
I have a plan, he said.

00:53:52.888 --> 00:53:55.550
Hawkeye, give me your coat.

00:53:55.610 --> 00:53:59.502
I must not wear my red soldier's coat in the village.

00:53:59.562 --> 00:54:03.193
I will be a medicine man, a French doctor.

00:54:03.253 --> 00:54:05.184
I will speak French.

00:54:05.245 --> 00:54:09.576
I will walk through the village and go into the houses.

00:54:09.636 --> 00:54:13.508
The Hurons will not hurt a medicine man.

00:54:13.568 --> 00:54:17.280
I will find Alice and Cora.

00:54:17.341 --> 00:54:20.848
It was a dangerous plan.

00:54:20.908 --> 00:54:24.124
Duncan put on Hawkeye's coat.

00:54:24.184 --> 00:54:27.506
Then he walked into the Huron's village.

00:54:27.566 --> 00:54:31.137
There was a large wooden building in front of him.

00:54:31.197 --> 00:54:34.578
It was the meeting house of the Huron chiefs.

00:54:34.638 --> 00:54:37.420
Duncan went inside.

00:54:37.480 --> 00:54:41.252
Some Huron chiefs were sitting together.

00:54:41.312 --> 00:54:44.153
They saw Duncan come in.

00:54:44.213 --> 00:54:47.014
One of the chiefs walked forward.

00:54:47.074 --> 00:54:51.590
His hair was grey, and he was tall and strong.

00:54:51.650 --> 00:54:58.098
He spoke to Duncan in the Huron language, but Duncan did not understand.

00:54:58.158 --> 00:55:00.280
Do you speak French?

00:55:00.340 --> 00:55:01.802
Duncan asked.

00:55:01.862 --> 00:55:04.534
The Huron replied in French.

00:55:04.594 --> 00:55:06.456
Why are you here?

00:55:06.516 --> 00:55:07.786
He asked.

00:55:07.846 --> 00:55:11.040
I am a medicine man, said Duncan.

00:55:11.100 --> 00:55:13.672
The King of France sent me.

00:55:13.732 --> 00:55:16.584
Are any Hurons ill?

00:55:16.644 --> 00:55:20.814
Suddenly there were loud cries from the forest.

00:55:20.874 --> 00:55:23.752
The chiefs left the meeting house.

00:55:23.812 --> 00:55:25.672
Duncan followed them.

00:55:25.732 --> 00:55:28.712
More Hurans were coming into the village.

00:55:28.772 --> 00:55:31.423
There was a prisoner in front of them.

00:55:31.483 --> 00:55:40.354
It was Uncas.

00:55:40.415 --> 00:55:55.238
Chapter 9 In the Hurans Village Unkas was not afraid.

00:55:55.298 --> 00:55:57.819
The Hurans ran around him.

00:55:57.879 --> 00:55:59.119
They shouted.

00:55:59.179 --> 00:56:02.180
They pulled him towards the wooden building.

00:56:02.240 --> 00:56:06.052
Unkas saw Duncan outside the building.

00:56:06.112 --> 00:56:10.673
Hawkeye is safe, Unkas, Duncan said quietly.

00:56:10.733 --> 00:56:15.174
Then the Hurans took Unkas into the meeting house.

00:56:15.234 --> 00:56:17.966
Duncan walked through the village.

00:56:18.026 --> 00:56:20.046
He looked in the houses.

00:56:20.106 --> 00:56:22.042
Nobody stopped him.

00:56:22.102 --> 00:56:25.030
Nobody asked any questions.

00:56:25.091 --> 00:56:29.524
But Duncan did not find Alice and Cora.

00:56:29.584 --> 00:56:32.306
He went back to the meeting-house.

00:56:32.366 --> 00:56:34.188
He went inside.

00:56:34.248 --> 00:56:38.230
UNKUS was standing, and the chiefs were sitting.

00:56:38.290 --> 00:56:40.642
Duncan sat down, too.

00:56:40.702 --> 00:56:43.364
He sat near the wall.

00:56:43.424 --> 00:56:46.768
Then another Huron came into the building.

00:56:46.828 --> 00:56:48.738
It was Magua.

00:56:48.798 --> 00:56:51.740
Magua did not see Duncan.

00:56:51.800 --> 00:56:53.700
but he saw UNKAS.

00:56:53.761 --> 00:56:58.584
He shouted, Mohekin, you must die!"

00:56:58.644 --> 00:57:01.026
Magua was angry.

00:57:01.086 --> 00:57:03.208
He turned to the chiefs.

00:57:03.268 --> 00:57:07.931
Many Hurans died at Glen's falls, he said.

00:57:07.992 --> 00:57:12.154
This Mohekin is our enemy!

00:57:12.214 --> 00:57:18.570
Magua and two Hurans took the young Mohekin out of the meeting house.

00:57:18.630 --> 00:57:22.332
Then one of the chiefs spoke to Duncan.

00:57:22.392 --> 00:57:27.354
Medicine man, the wife of one of my men is ill.

00:57:27.414 --> 00:57:29.124
She is sick.

00:57:29.184 --> 00:57:31.285
Can you make her well?"

00:57:31.305 --> 00:57:35.886
"'Take me to the woman,' said Duncan.

00:57:35.946 --> 00:57:39.808
He followed the chief out of the meeting-house.

00:57:39.868 --> 00:57:42.279
They went towards a hill.

00:57:42.339 --> 00:57:45.290
There was a cave in the hill.

00:57:45.350 --> 00:57:51.272
Duncan saw a bear following them, but he was not afraid.

00:57:51.332 --> 00:57:53.962
Indians liked bears.

00:57:54.022 --> 00:57:57.672
They often had bears in their villages.

00:57:57.732 --> 00:58:01.824
Duncan followed the chief into the cave.

00:58:01.884 --> 00:58:07.885
The cave was large, and there were many rooms with stone walls.

00:58:07.945 --> 00:58:12.046
The chief took Duncan into one room.

00:58:12.106 --> 00:58:15.617
The sick woman was lying on the ground.

00:58:15.677 --> 00:58:18.238
Some other women were with her.

00:58:18.298 --> 00:58:21.056
Duncan looked at the sick woman.

00:58:21.116 --> 00:58:25.734
She is dying, he thought.

00:58:25.794 --> 00:58:31.606
The Huron Chief waited and looked at Duncan.

00:58:31.667 --> 00:58:34.718
Duncan turned to the Huron Chief.

00:58:34.778 --> 00:58:39.079
I must look at this sick woman alone, he said.

00:58:39.139 --> 00:58:41.470
My medicine is secret.

00:58:41.530 --> 00:58:44.200
Go with these four women.

00:58:44.260 --> 00:58:46.532
Wait outside.

00:58:46.592 --> 00:58:52.055
The Chief and the four women left the cave.

00:58:52.115 --> 00:58:56.759
A few minutes later the bear came into the cave.

00:58:56.819 --> 00:59:00.591
The bear made a loud noise.

00:59:00.651 --> 00:59:03.893
Duncan looked at the bear.

00:59:03.953 --> 00:59:07.204
Again the bear made a loud noise.

00:59:07.264 --> 00:59:09.816
It walked towards Duncan.

00:59:09.876 --> 00:59:12.538
Suddenly it took off its head.

00:59:12.598 --> 00:59:14.468
It was Hawkeye.

00:59:14.528 --> 00:59:18.640
Hawkeye was wearing a bear's skin.

00:59:18.700 --> 00:59:20.022
What?

00:59:20.082 --> 00:59:21.294
Said Duncan.

00:59:21.354 --> 00:59:22.407
Then he laughed.

00:59:22.427 --> 00:59:25.538
"'Why are you wearing a bear's skin?'

00:59:25.598 --> 00:59:26.899
he asked.

00:59:26.959 --> 00:59:31.290
"'I found the bear's skin in a Huron's house,' said Hawkeye.

00:59:31.310 --> 00:59:33.911
"'Now the Huron's will not stop me.

00:59:33.931 --> 00:59:37.392
"'But tell me, where is Miss Alice?

00:59:37.412 --> 00:59:39.893
"'I have been unlucky.

00:59:39.913 --> 00:59:43.594
"'I have not found Alice or Cora.

00:59:43.614 --> 00:59:47.700
"'And Unca's is a prisoner of the Huron's.

00:59:47.761 --> 00:59:53.600
Magua has taken Miss Cora to the village of the Delaware's," said Hawkeye.

00:59:53.660 --> 00:59:57.044
I heard two heurons talking about her.

00:59:57.104 --> 01:00:01.818
Chingacuk and Monroe are safe in the forest.

01:00:01.878 --> 01:00:04.630
Then Hawkeye heard a noise.

01:00:04.690 --> 01:00:06.962
He looked over a stone wall.

01:00:07.022 --> 01:00:10.895
Miss Alice is in the next room, he said.

01:00:10.956 --> 01:00:13.833
Duncan went into the next room.

01:00:13.893 --> 01:00:18.550
There were some blankets, cloths and animal skins in the room.

01:00:18.610 --> 01:00:20.752
And there was Alice.

01:00:20.812 --> 01:00:24.013
Her hands and feet were tied with rope.

01:00:24.073 --> 01:00:26.264
Her face was white.

01:00:26.324 --> 01:00:28.205
She was afraid.

01:00:28.265 --> 01:00:31.877
Duncan, she said, you are here!

01:00:31.937 --> 01:00:34.038
Yes, said Duncan.

01:00:34.098 --> 01:00:36.620
He untied her hands and feet.

01:00:36.680 --> 01:00:38.150
Where is Cora?

01:00:38.210 --> 01:00:39.411
asked Alice.

01:00:39.471 --> 01:00:41.372
Where is my father?

01:00:41.432 --> 01:00:43.530
Your father is safe.

01:00:43.590 --> 01:00:49.592
He is with Chingacuk, said Duncan, and Cora, Alice asked again.

01:00:49.652 --> 01:00:51.615
She is near here.

01:00:51.675 --> 01:00:54.668
She is at another village, said Duncan.

01:00:54.728 --> 01:00:57.331
She is with the Delaware's.

01:00:57.391 --> 01:01:01.526
Suddenly, somebody came into the room.

01:01:01.586 --> 01:01:13.864
It was Magua.

01:01:13.924 --> 01:01:31.244
Chapter 10 The Bear Magua looked at Duncan and Alice.

01:01:31.304 --> 01:01:34.196
He laughed and went towards them.

01:01:34.256 --> 01:01:37.128
Suddenly the bear was in the room.

01:01:37.188 --> 01:01:39.480
It quickly held Magua.

01:01:39.540 --> 01:01:41.842
Magua could not move.

01:01:41.902 --> 01:01:44.344
He could not turn round.

01:01:44.404 --> 01:01:46.925
Duncan ran to the Huron.

01:01:46.985 --> 01:01:49.446
He tied Magua's arms.

01:01:49.506 --> 01:01:52.218
Then he tied Magua's feet.

01:01:52.278 --> 01:01:54.530
Magua started to speak.

01:01:54.590 --> 01:01:58.462
But Duncan put a cloth into his mouth.

01:01:58.522 --> 01:02:01.724
Hawkeye took off the bear's head.

01:02:01.784 --> 01:02:04.286
We must go quickly, he said.

01:02:04.346 --> 01:02:07.048
Alice, you will wear a blanket.

01:02:07.108 --> 01:02:09.920
You will be the sick Huron woman.

01:02:09.980 --> 01:02:13.352
Then you can leave the Huron's village.

01:02:13.413 --> 01:02:16.954
Hawkeye put on the bear's head again.

01:02:17.014 --> 01:02:20.117
Alice put a blanket over her head.

01:02:20.177 --> 01:02:23.366
Duncan carried Alice out of the cave.

01:02:23.426 --> 01:02:26.813
and Hawkeye followed Duncan.

01:02:26.874 --> 01:02:31.105
The Huron Chief was outside the cave.

01:02:31.165 --> 01:02:35.627
I am taking the sick woman away, said Duncan.

01:02:35.687 --> 01:02:39.018
I will bring her to your house tomorrow.

01:02:39.078 --> 01:02:44.040
Hawkeye, Duncan, and Alice left the village.

01:02:44.100 --> 01:02:48.282
Then Hawkeye led Duncan and Alice to a path.

01:02:48.342 --> 01:02:53.554
This path goes to a small river, Hawkeye said to them.

01:02:53.614 --> 01:02:55.775
You will see a hill.

01:02:55.835 --> 01:02:59.796
The village of the Delaware's is near the hill.

01:02:59.856 --> 01:03:02.856
You will be safe with the Delaware's."

01:03:02.917 --> 01:03:05.077
What are you going to do?"

01:03:05.137 --> 01:03:06.767
asked Duncan.

01:03:06.827 --> 01:03:11.618
I must go back for Unkas," said Hawkeye.

01:03:11.678 --> 01:03:14.979
It was dark in the village.

01:03:15.039 --> 01:03:17.679
The Hurans were in their houses.

01:03:17.739 --> 01:03:19.530
They were asleep.

01:03:19.590 --> 01:03:22.564
Hawkeye was looking for Unkas.

01:03:22.624 --> 01:03:25.890
The scout was wearing the bear's skin.

01:03:25.950 --> 01:03:28.872
He looked in all the buildings.

01:03:28.933 --> 01:03:32.766
Then he saw two men outside a house.

01:03:32.826 --> 01:03:36.648
They were guards, but they were asleep.

01:03:36.708 --> 01:03:41.082
Hawkeye quietly went inside the house.

01:03:41.142 --> 01:03:44.244
Onkas was lying on the floor.

01:03:44.304 --> 01:03:47.796
His hands and feet were tied with rope.

01:03:47.856 --> 01:03:50.799
Hawkeye took off the bear's head.

01:03:50.859 --> 01:03:52.703
Onkas smiled.

01:03:52.763 --> 01:03:56.908
Hawkeye," he said quietly.

01:03:56.968 --> 01:04:01.931
Hawkeye untied Unkus' hands and feet.

01:04:01.991 --> 01:04:05.182
Then he took off the bear's skin.

01:04:05.243 --> 01:04:09.095
Unkus and Hawkeye ran quickly from the village.

01:04:09.115 --> 01:04:13.377
"'We shall go to the Delaware's village,' said Hawkeye.

01:04:13.397 --> 01:04:15.358
"'Yes,' said Unkus.

01:04:15.378 --> 01:04:19.120
"'The Delaware's are the children of my grandfather.

01:04:19.180 --> 01:04:21.674
They will help us."

01:04:21.734 --> 01:04:26.719
The next morning, the Hurons went to get Onkas.

01:04:26.780 --> 01:04:28.821
They were going to kill him.

01:04:28.881 --> 01:04:31.513
They found the bear's skin.

01:04:31.573 --> 01:04:34.736
But they did not find the Mohican.

01:04:34.796 --> 01:04:37.208
Then they went to the cave.

01:04:37.268 --> 01:04:39.630
They found a dead woman.

01:04:39.690 --> 01:04:42.332
But they did not find Alice.

01:04:42.392 --> 01:04:44.284
They found Magua.

01:04:44.344 --> 01:04:46.806
His hands and feet were tied.

01:04:46.866 --> 01:04:49.302
A cloth was in his mouth.

01:04:49.362 --> 01:04:53.140
The Huron's untied Magua's hands and feet.

01:04:53.200 --> 01:04:55.860
They took the cloth from his mouth.

01:04:55.920 --> 01:04:57.972
Magua was angry.

01:04:58.032 --> 01:05:00.773
Kill the Mohican prisoner, now!

01:05:00.833 --> 01:05:01.903
He shouted.

01:05:01.963 --> 01:05:04.804
He has gone, said one of the chiefs.

01:05:04.864 --> 01:05:13.018
Magua shouted with anger, and he ran out of the cave.

01:05:13.078 --> 01:05:25.368
Chapter 11 The Old Chief Magua went to the Delaware's village.

01:05:25.428 --> 01:05:31.680
The Delaware's were friends of France, but they did not fight in the war.

01:05:31.740 --> 01:05:35.172
Magua went to the Delaware's meeting-house.

01:05:35.232 --> 01:05:37.503
The Delaware Chiefs were talking.

01:05:37.523 --> 01:05:41.905
"'The Huron Chief is welcome,' said the Delaware.

01:05:41.925 --> 01:05:45.277
"'Is my woman prisoner safe and well?'

01:05:45.337 --> 01:05:46.207
asked Magua.

01:05:46.227 --> 01:05:49.058
"'She is well,' said the Delaware.

01:05:49.118 --> 01:05:54.288
Then Magua said, Are there strangers in the forest, white men?"

01:05:54.348 --> 01:05:58.380
There are strangers in the village, said the Delaware.

01:05:58.440 --> 01:06:04.862
They are in my house, but strangers are always welcome in this village.

01:06:04.922 --> 01:06:08.513
What will the King of France say about this?

01:06:08.573 --> 01:06:09.754
said Magua.

01:06:09.814 --> 01:06:14.395
His greatest enemy is here in the Delaware's village.

01:06:14.455 --> 01:06:17.434
This enemy is a white man.

01:06:17.494 --> 01:06:21.164
He kills many friends of the French.

01:06:21.225 --> 01:06:25.027
Which white man is an enemy of France?

01:06:25.087 --> 01:06:26.668
asked the Delaware Chief.

01:06:26.728 --> 01:06:28.109
The scout!

01:06:28.169 --> 01:06:29.290
Hawkeye!

01:06:29.350 --> 01:06:30.320
said Magua.

01:06:30.380 --> 01:06:31.971
The long gun!

01:06:32.032 --> 01:06:35.224
The other strangers are his friends.

01:06:35.284 --> 01:06:38.846
They are the enemies of France too.

01:06:38.906 --> 01:06:42.668
The Delaware's started to talk quietly.

01:06:42.728 --> 01:06:45.739
One of them left the meeting house quickly.

01:06:45.800 --> 01:06:49.740
A few minutes later, he came back.

01:06:49.801 --> 01:06:55.243
Then a very old man came into the meeting-house.

01:06:55.303 --> 01:06:58.954
Two young Delaware's helped the old man.

01:06:59.014 --> 01:07:04.036
He had long, white hair, and there were many lines on his face.

01:07:04.096 --> 01:07:08.448
The Chiefs spoke his name, Tamanund.

01:07:08.508 --> 01:07:12.724
Magua knew the name of this famous Delaware Chief.

01:07:12.784 --> 01:07:17.161
Tamunund was more than one hundred years old.

01:07:17.222 --> 01:07:19.693
Tamunund sat down.

01:07:19.753 --> 01:07:23.176
Then he spoke to the two young tellerwares.

01:07:23.236 --> 01:07:26.618
They got up and went away.

01:07:26.678 --> 01:07:33.562
Soon they came back with Alice, Cora, Duncan and Hawkeye.

01:07:33.622 --> 01:07:36.163
Cora was very angry.

01:07:36.223 --> 01:07:38.284
She spoke to the chiefs.

01:07:38.344 --> 01:07:42.966
Yesterday we were welcome in this village, she said.

01:07:43.026 --> 01:07:46.026
The Delaware's were our friends.

01:07:46.086 --> 01:07:48.927
Today we are your prisoners.

01:07:48.987 --> 01:07:51.878
Why are we prisoners?"

01:07:51.938 --> 01:07:54.908
Tamanund did not answer.

01:07:54.968 --> 01:07:57.959
Which man is Hawkeye?

01:07:58.019 --> 01:07:59.639
The long gun!

01:07:59.699 --> 01:08:00.950
He asked.

01:08:01.010 --> 01:08:04.060
Hawkeye walked forward.

01:08:04.080 --> 01:08:06.261
I am Hawkeye, he said.

01:08:06.321 --> 01:08:09.281
Then Tamanund spoke quickly to Magua.

01:08:09.341 --> 01:08:10.762
Take your prisoner!

01:08:10.822 --> 01:08:12.666
The dark-haired woman!

01:08:12.726 --> 01:08:13.530
"'Go!'

01:08:13.591 --> 01:08:14.681
he said.

01:08:14.742 --> 01:08:17.674
But Cora spoke to the old chief.

01:08:17.694 --> 01:08:21.918
"'Another man came to this village with us,' she said.

01:08:21.938 --> 01:08:24.991
"'Now he is a prisoner too.

01:08:25.051 --> 01:08:28.073
But he is one of your own people.

01:08:28.134 --> 01:08:30.356
He will tell our story.

01:08:30.416 --> 01:08:33.559
Please listen to him.'

01:08:33.619 --> 01:08:35.891
Tamanan looked at the chiefs.

01:08:35.911 --> 01:08:39.544
"'Who is this other prisoner?'

01:08:39.604 --> 01:08:40.629
he asked.

01:08:40.689 --> 01:08:43.964
"'He fights for the English,' Magua said quickly.

01:08:43.984 --> 01:08:45.385
"'You must kill him.'

01:08:45.405 --> 01:08:49.006
"'Bring him here,' said Tamanund.

01:08:49.026 --> 01:08:51.788
"'Two men left the meeting house.

01:08:51.808 --> 01:08:57.650
"'Soon they came back with Onkas.

01:08:57.710 --> 01:09:01.332
Onkas was not wearing a shirt.

01:09:01.352 --> 01:09:03.553
"'His hands were tied.

01:09:03.573 --> 01:09:06.254
"'He stood in front of Tamanund.

01:09:06.274 --> 01:09:09.348
"'The old chief looked at him.

01:09:09.407 --> 01:09:13.871
Tamanund saw a tattoo on Onkus's chest.

01:09:13.931 --> 01:09:16.552
It was a picture of a turtle.

01:09:16.612 --> 01:09:19.172
Who are you?

01:09:19.232 --> 01:09:21.343
The old chief asked.

01:09:21.403 --> 01:09:29.665
I am Onkus, son of Chingajkuk, son of the great Unamis, the turtle, Onkus replied.

01:09:29.725 --> 01:09:35.306
Chingajkuk and Onkus are the last of the Mohicans.

01:09:35.366 --> 01:09:38.722
Tamanund looked at Onkus.

01:09:38.783 --> 01:09:41.219
Then he smiled at the young Mohican.

01:09:41.239 --> 01:09:46.361
"'Your father is a great chief,' he said.

01:09:46.381 --> 01:09:49.403
Duncan suddenly saw Hawkeye.

01:09:49.423 --> 01:09:52.664
"'Delaware father,' he said to Tamanund.

01:09:52.684 --> 01:09:55.226
"'This is my friend Hawkeye.

01:09:55.246 --> 01:09:58.387
"'He is a friend of the Delaware's.

01:09:58.407 --> 01:10:01.018
"'The long gun?'

01:10:01.078 --> 01:10:02.049
said Tamanund.

01:10:02.069 --> 01:10:05.751
"'He is not a friend of the Delaware's.

01:10:05.771 --> 01:10:09.450
"'He kills our young men.

01:10:09.510 --> 01:10:11.568
Then Hawkeye spoke.

01:10:11.588 --> 01:10:14.449
"'I kill Hurans,' he said.

01:10:14.469 --> 01:10:17.170
"'I have never killed a Delaware.'

01:10:17.190 --> 01:10:22.561
"'The Delaware's believed Hawkeye's words.

01:10:22.621 --> 01:10:24.731
Tamanund looked at UNKAS.

01:10:24.751 --> 01:10:29.172
"'Why are you the Hurans prisoner?'

01:10:29.232 --> 01:10:30.463
he asked.

01:10:30.523 --> 01:10:34.634
"'I helped the English woman,' said UNKAS.

01:10:34.694 --> 01:10:37.354
Tamanund looked at Cora.

01:10:37.414 --> 01:10:40.190
Then he spoke to Magua.

01:10:40.250 --> 01:10:44.937
And why is the English woman your prisoner?"

01:10:44.997 --> 01:10:46.928
he asked.

01:10:46.948 --> 01:10:49.940
I hate the English, said Magua.

01:10:50.000 --> 01:10:54.972
Now the daughter of an English chief is my prisoner.

01:10:55.032 --> 01:11:00.376
Now the daughter of Monroe will be my wife.

01:11:00.436 --> 01:11:04.067
Magua went to Cora and held her arm.

01:11:04.127 --> 01:11:06.048
Wait, shouted Duncan.

01:11:06.108 --> 01:11:07.309
Don't take her.

01:11:07.369 --> 01:11:09.721
The English will give you money.

01:11:09.781 --> 01:11:12.313
But Magua did not listen.

01:11:12.373 --> 01:11:14.644
He pulled Cora towards the door.

01:11:14.664 --> 01:11:17.005
"'Come,' he said to her.

01:11:17.025 --> 01:11:20.547
"'I am your prisoner,' Cora said to Magua.

01:11:20.567 --> 01:11:23.468
"'But do not touch me.'

01:11:23.528 --> 01:11:25.289
She turned to Duncan.

01:11:25.309 --> 01:11:29.951
"'Please take care of my young sister,' she said.

01:11:30.011 --> 01:11:32.062
She kissed Alice.

01:11:32.122 --> 01:11:34.093
Then she spoke to Magua.

01:11:34.113 --> 01:11:37.169
"'I will come with you.'

01:11:37.229 --> 01:11:40.006
And I will come too, shouted Duncan.

01:11:40.066 --> 01:11:41.477
I will help you, Cora.

01:11:41.537 --> 01:11:43.239
Wait," said Hawkeye.

01:11:43.299 --> 01:11:45.080
He held Duncan's arm.

01:11:45.140 --> 01:11:47.992
Hawkeye spoke quickly and quietly.

01:11:48.052 --> 01:11:51.966
Magua's friends are waiting in the forest, he said.

01:11:52.026 --> 01:11:53.788
They will kill you.

01:11:53.848 --> 01:11:56.180
You're on, said Unkas.

01:11:56.240 --> 01:11:57.840
We will find you.

01:11:57.900 --> 01:12:00.072
We will kill you.

01:12:00.132 --> 01:12:01.884
But Magua laughed.

01:12:01.944 --> 01:12:04.436
More he can, said Magua.

01:12:04.496 --> 01:12:06.941
You cannot kill me.

01:12:07.000 --> 01:12:09.444
I am too strong.

01:12:09.504 --> 01:12:13.436
Stay here with your brothers, the Delaware's.

01:12:13.496 --> 01:12:15.087
They are weak.

01:12:15.147 --> 01:12:19.318
They like their homes and their food.

01:12:19.378 --> 01:12:21.980
They do not like fighting.

01:12:22.040 --> 01:12:24.962
They will not help you."

01:12:25.022 --> 01:12:28.643
Then Magua walked out of the meeting house.

01:12:28.703 --> 01:12:30.954
Cora followed him.

01:12:31.014 --> 01:12:35.372
Unca spoke to Tamanund.

01:12:35.432 --> 01:12:40.814
We must follow the English woman."

01:12:40.874 --> 01:12:44.490
Tamanant called the young man of the village.

01:12:44.550 --> 01:12:47.514
"'Go with the Mohican,' he said.

01:12:47.534 --> 01:12:59.146
"'The Hurans are now our enemies.'

01:12:59.206 --> 01:13:07.832
Chapter 12.

01:13:07.892 --> 01:13:15.957
The Last of the Mohicans Magua and Cora walked into the forest.

01:13:16.017 --> 01:13:19.500
They walked towards the Huron's village.

01:13:19.559 --> 01:13:25.952
An hour later, Hawkeye, Duncan, and UNKUS followed Magua's trail.

01:13:26.012 --> 01:13:30.846
Two hundred young Delaware's went with the three friends.

01:13:30.906 --> 01:13:34.250
Alice stayed in the Delaware's village.

01:13:34.310 --> 01:13:37.163
Hawkeye spoke to UNKAS.

01:13:37.223 --> 01:13:42.584
Major Hayward and I will find Chingotchkook and General Monroe, he said.

01:13:42.644 --> 01:13:45.005
They are safe in the forest.

01:13:45.065 --> 01:13:47.955
UNKAS, take the Delaware's with you.

01:13:48.015 --> 01:13:50.186
Follow Magua's trail.

01:13:50.246 --> 01:13:51.816
Be careful.

01:13:51.876 --> 01:13:54.716
There will be many Hurons in the forest.

01:13:54.776 --> 01:13:58.217
We will meet you at the Huron's village.

01:13:58.277 --> 01:14:03.168
Magua will take Cora to the cave in the hill, said Hawkeye.

01:14:03.228 --> 01:14:04.777
We will find her.

01:14:04.837 --> 01:14:06.837
We will help her.

01:14:06.897 --> 01:14:07.917
Come!"

01:14:07.977 --> 01:14:10.039
said Duncan.

01:14:10.098 --> 01:14:15.781
Hawkeye and Duncan soon found Chingotchkook and Monroe.

01:14:15.841 --> 01:14:18.712
They quickly told Monroe their story.

01:14:18.772 --> 01:14:22.364
Then the four men went to the Huron's village.

01:14:22.424 --> 01:14:27.127
They walked up the hill towards the cave.

01:14:27.187 --> 01:14:31.899
Suddenly they heard shouts and cries.

01:14:31.959 --> 01:14:34.037
They looked down at the village.

01:14:34.098 --> 01:14:38.416
Uncas and the Delaware's were fighting the Hurans in the village.

01:14:38.476 --> 01:14:42.376
Then Magua and some Hurans ran up the hill.

01:14:42.436 --> 01:14:44.597
They were going to the cave.

01:14:44.657 --> 01:14:47.097
Uncas was running after them.

01:14:47.157 --> 01:14:50.558
Hawkeye and his friends fought the Hurans.

01:14:50.618 --> 01:14:54.858
The fight was terrible, but Magua escaped.

01:14:54.918 --> 01:15:02.160
Then Hawkeye, Duncan, Monroe, the Mohicans and their friends saw Magua again.

01:15:02.220 --> 01:15:04.457
He was with another Huran.

01:15:04.517 --> 01:15:07.045
They were in front of the cave.

01:15:07.105 --> 01:15:11.167
The two Indians were pulling Cora from the cave.

01:15:11.227 --> 01:15:13.328
Cora, shouted Duncan.

01:15:13.388 --> 01:15:14.968
There is Cora.

01:15:15.028 --> 01:15:18.710
Unkus ran towards the rocks above the cave.

01:15:18.771 --> 01:15:21.532
Cora had stopped in front of the cave.

01:15:21.592 --> 01:15:23.893
Magua took out his knife.

01:15:23.953 --> 01:15:25.534
He turned to Cora.

01:15:25.594 --> 01:15:27.475
Woman, he shouted.

01:15:27.535 --> 01:15:30.266
Will you be the wife of Magua?

01:15:30.326 --> 01:15:32.218
Or will you die?

01:15:32.278 --> 01:15:35.190
Kill me, Magua," Cora said.

01:15:35.250 --> 01:15:37.812
I will not go with you.

01:15:37.872 --> 01:15:40.172
Suddenly there was a crime.

01:15:40.232 --> 01:15:43.564
Bunkas was standing on the rocks above them.

01:15:43.624 --> 01:15:45.316
Magua looked up.

01:15:45.376 --> 01:15:47.718
The other Huron turned to Cora.

01:15:47.778 --> 01:15:51.840
He stabbed her with his knife and killed her.

01:15:51.900 --> 01:15:54.322
Magua shouted angrily.

01:15:54.382 --> 01:15:57.564
He lifted his knife and killed the Huron.

01:15:57.624 --> 01:16:00.226
Then Bunkas jumped on Magua.

01:16:00.286 --> 01:16:01.439
They fought.

01:16:01.499 --> 01:16:03.573
But Magua turned quickly.

01:16:03.633 --> 01:16:06.456
He stabbed Onkus four times.

01:16:06.515 --> 01:16:09.228
The young Mohican stood for a moment.

01:16:09.287 --> 01:16:12.040
Then he fell at Magua's feet.

01:16:12.100 --> 01:16:13.600
Dead.

01:16:13.660 --> 01:16:16.152
Hawkeye saw Onkus fall.

01:16:16.212 --> 01:16:19.014
The scout ran towards Magua.

01:16:19.074 --> 01:16:21.266
Magua ran up the path.

01:16:21.326 --> 01:16:23.318
His enemies were below him.

01:16:23.378 --> 01:16:25.599
Magua climbed up the rocks.

01:16:25.659 --> 01:16:28.020
Then he turned and looked down.

01:16:28.080 --> 01:16:30.423
Hawkeye stopped running.

01:16:30.483 --> 01:16:33.045
He lifted his long gun.

01:16:33.105 --> 01:16:37.756
Magua jumped towards a higher rock and Hawkeye fired.

01:16:37.816 --> 01:16:44.519
Magua's fingers touched the rock, but the bullet from Hawkeye's gun killed him.

01:16:44.579 --> 01:16:52.130
And his body fell down and down onto the rocks.

01:16:52.189 --> 01:17:02.011
A day later, General Monroe, Duncan, and Alice stood by the graves of Uncas and Cora.

01:17:02.071 --> 01:17:04.942
They were sad and silent.

01:17:05.002 --> 01:17:13.506
Then they said goodbye to Hawkeye, Chingachkuk, and the Delaware's, and they walked away into the forest.

01:17:13.566 --> 01:17:16.758
Chingachkuk looked at Hawkeye.

01:17:16.818 --> 01:17:23.072
All the people of my tribe have gone now, he said.

01:17:23.132 --> 01:17:25.545
Alone?

01:17:25.605 --> 01:17:27.977
No, said Hawkeye.

01:17:28.037 --> 01:17:33.472
Ounkas has gone, but you are not alone.

01:17:33.532 --> 01:17:36.874
He put his hand on Chingotchkook's hand.

01:17:36.934 --> 01:17:45.482
The tears of the two friends fell onto the gray of Ounkas.

01:17:45.541 --> 01:17:57.868
In 1758, General Monroe died Alice married Duncan Hayward, and they lived happily together.

01:17:57.928 --> 01:18:10.870
From that time, the Delaware's told their children the story of the English woman and the young Mohican, and they told their children the words of Tamanun, the old chief.

01:18:10.930 --> 01:18:15.724
The time of the Red Man has gone.

01:18:15.784 --> 01:18:28.723
We fought for our land, but now there are many white men as many as the leaves on the trees.

01:18:28.743 --> 01:18:31.706
I have lived too long.

01:18:31.766 --> 01:18:46.917
I have seen the last of the Mohicans.

01:18:46.977 --> 01:19:05.543
The last of the Mohicans was read by William Roberts, and the recording was produced by James Richardson at Studio ADP London.

